     <widget class="TimelineCanvas" name="canvas">
      <property name="whatsThis"><string>The session on a time axis. Top lanes: the activity phase of each robot skin. Then one lane per child (or skin, or sensor) with each touch as a bar as long as the touch lasted. Then what the robot did (dark: its own initiative; light: answering a touch), its buttons and other inputs, and what the observer coded. Hover any mark to read it.</string></property>
